      "source": "Interface to allow execution of Query by Example <a href=\"../../domain/Example.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Example</code></a> instances. This an extension to\n<a href=\"QueryByExampleExecutor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.repository.query\"><code>QueryByExampleExecutor</code></a> returning <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/List.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>List</code></a> instead of <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Iterable.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Iterable</code></a> where applicable.",
      "translation": "提供执行基于示例（Example）查询的接口。该接口扩展了 <a href=\"QueryByExampleExecutor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.repository.query\"><code>QueryByExampleExecutor</code></a>，在适用情况下返回 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/List.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>List</code></a> 而非 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Iterable.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Iterable</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns all entities matching the given <a href=\"../../domain/Example.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Example</code></a> applying the given <a href=\"../../domain/Sort.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort</code></a>. In case no match could be\nfound an empty <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/List.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>List</code></a> is returned.",
      "translation": "返回所有与给定<a href=\"../../domain/Example.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Example</code></a>匹配并应用给定<a href=\"../../domain/Sort.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort</code></a>的实体。如果未找到任何匹配项，则返回一个空的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/List.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>List</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
